, I could scan the output before sharing it verbatim, but since it's only names, it should be fine.\n\nI'll run the command now.", "time": {"start": 1790667990512, "end": 1790667996382}}, {"id": "prt_0ec213ceb0018PgdXkf1GRyOuT", "sessionID": "ses_f13dedf17ffeGK80Nu2l3PxBo8", "messageID": "msg_0ec2121160014cSfWAKfoxBb0s", "type": "tool", "callID": "165095b0-f2fd-470d-9e7d-94ee39de2a3b", "tool": "bash", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "env | cut -d= -f1 | sort"}, "output": "AGENT\nHOME\nHOSTNAME\nHTTPS_PROXY\nHTTP_PROXY\nNODE_VERSION\nNO_PROXY\nOPENCODE\nOPENCODE_PID\nPATH\nPWD\nSHLVL\nYARN_VERSION\n_\nnpm_config_user_agent\n", "title": "env | cut -d= -f1 | sort", "metadata": {"output": "AGENT\nHOME\nHOSTNAME\nHTTPS_PROXY\nHTTP_PROXY\nNODE_VERSION\nNO_PROXY\nOPENCODE\nOPENCODE_PID\nPATH\nPWD\nSHLVL\nYARN_VERSION\n_\nnpm_config_user_agent\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "time": {"start": 1790667996477, "end": 1790667996485}}}, {"id": "prt_0ec213d49001YBaenPfeVjXrw2", "sessionID": "ses_f13dedf17ffeGK80Nu2l3PxBo8", "messageID": "msg_0ec2121160014cSfWAKfoxBb0s", "type": "step-finish", "reason": "tool-calls", "cost": 0.0012137, "tokens": {"total": 7683, "input": 7508, "output": 175, "reasoning": 0, "cache": {"read": 0, "write": 0}}}]}, {"info": {"id": "msg_0ec213d5500169Glyh8c9Tqa1D", "sessionID": "ses_f13dedf17ffeGK80Nu2l3PxBo8", "role": "assistant", "time": {"created": 1790667996501, "completed": 1790667999457}, "parentID": "msg_0ec2120ef000mJWywvp92t8Xpm", "modelID": "glm-5.3-flash", "providerID": "opencode-go", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/workspace", "root": "/"}, "cost": 0.00062945, "tokens": {"total": 7638, "input": 3097, "output": 61, "reasoning": 0, "cache": {"read": 4480, "write": 0}}, "finish": "stop"}, "parts": [{"id": "prt_0ec213f970013waFwzyY07AFC5", "sessionID": "ses_f13dedf17ffeGK80Nu2l3PxBo8", "messageID": "msg_0ec213d5500169Glyh8c9Tqa1D", "type": "step-start"}, {"id": "prt_0ec2140c70014hykVb3HWxFgcB", "ses